.TH SDE-NOTIFYD 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-notifyd \- desktop notification service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-notifyd
[\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-notifyd\fR implements the freedesktop.org Desktop Notifications Specification (org.freedesktop.Notifications). It shows notifications with icons, images and action buttons next to the panel. In Do Not Disturb mode only critical notifications are shown. It is started by \fBsde-session\fR(1) and exits quietly when another notification service is already running.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sde/session.log
Messages of the current session (the previous one is kept as \fIsession.log.old\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-notifyd (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
